WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.833
Step 1: Open Learning centre → In-store training. Use the location, search and status filters to find your sessions.

2
00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:15.833
Step 2: With training assignment access, choose New session. Set the location, trainer, date, Melbourne start time, duration, staff and practical skills, then press Create session.

3
00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:26.083
Step 3: Open View session and choose a staff member. The appointed trainer or an authorised manager ticks only the skills demonstrated competently, adds any notes and presses Save assessment.

4
00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:36.042
Step 4: Save partial progress until every skill is signed off. The final save records completion, the assessor and the time. Find these read-only records using the Completed filter.
